# The cascade screen's raw run jsonl is 57 MB for 72,779 rows. The house
# pattern (see results/heuristic_search/ac19_autmin_screen/) commits the
# residues and the certificates, not the screen itself.
results/heuristic_search/ac19_cascade_screen/ac19_cascade_screen_*.jsonl
results/heuristic_search/ac19_extended_screen/ac19_cascade_screen_*.jsonl
!results/heuristic_search/*/*_certificates.jsonl
results/heuristic_search/ac19_cascade_screen_smoke/
results/heuristic_search/ac19_extended_screen_smoke/

# Seeded design-canvas payload: 2.8 MB build output, regenerated by
